flowchart TD
  start([Customer complaint]) --> reg[Register and acknowledge]
  reg --> safety{Safety related?}
  safety -->|Yes| vig[[Vigilance report to the authority]]
  safety -->|No| inv[Investigate the returned product]
  vig --> inv
  inv --> db[(Complaint log)]
  inv --> capa{CAPA needed?}
  capa -->|Yes| open[Open CAPA]
  capa -->|No| reply[Reply to the customer]
  open --> reply
  reply --> done([Closed])
